# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output. frontend/dist is NOT ignored: the ZPM module ships the built SPA
# (see module.xml), so the files have to be in the repository for an install from
# a clone or the registry to have a UI. Run `npm run build` and commit it along
# with any frontend change; the Docker image rebuilds it from source and ignores
# this copy.

